Subject: [PATCH 306/371] family server (11-20): finishing Jack's grenade quest
 gives 25 grenades to throw (0390)

Server: GrenadeReward gave the grenade weapon but no grenade ammo. Lane: combat. Test: test_grenade_reward_ammo.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 pirates/quest/QuestReward.py | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/pirates/quest/QuestReward.py b/pirates/quest/QuestReward.py
index 97fc541..1110464 100644
--- a/pirates/quest/QuestReward.py
+++ b/pirates/quest/QuestReward.py
@@ -419,6 +419,9 @@ class GrenadeReward(QuestReward):
         trade.giveGrenadeTraining()
         trade.giveStack(InventoryType.GrenadeWeaponL1, 1)
         trade.giveStack(InventoryType.GrenadeExplosion, 2)
+        # the grenade came with nothing to throw (explosives are not infinite
+        # like pistol shot); the inventory caps this at the pouch limit
+        trade.giveStack(InventoryType.AmmoGrenadeExplosion, 25)
 
     def getDescriptionText(self):
         return PLocalizer.GrenadeRewardDesc
